<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St George year net A$159.51 million.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St George year net A$159.51 million.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>		(in A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    263.75  vs 217.08</p>
<p>    Net profit			    159.51  vs 135.49</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     26.0   vs  26.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		   52 vs 51.0</p>
<p>    Interest income (billion)	    1.72 vs 1.52</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     1,098  vs 980.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss   8.46 vs  loss 6.96</p>
<p>    Other income			   124.07 vs 108.36</p>
<p>    Tax					 95.26 vs  74.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    42.42 vs  43.06</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date January 3, 1997</p>
<p>Reg date December 16</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name St George Bank Ltd. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
